  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forecast based Anticipatory Action to Strengthen Food Security and Coping Capacity of Households-at-highest risk (EAST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this anticipatory action project for floods in Nepal is to provide early warning messages and multi-purpose cash assistance to communities on the basis of early flood warnings in Sunsari and Saptari. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 45,185 people, including 15,720 women, 14,174 men, 15,291 children, and including 996 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
